      "content": "that's a really good start, obad sounds intimidating. i want to lean even harder into that contrast for the world-building. \n\ncan you go into more detail about the culture of his people? i want to understand what makes them so naturally different from the empire. like, is it just their clothes, or is there something about their temperament or how they think that makes them more naturally suited for that chaotic, untamed lifestyle compared to the more disciplined and intellectual empire?",
